         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit Kainode →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">3.7/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Kainode is a young Wyoming-registered hosting brand (2025 launch) operating VDS plans from Singapore, Germany, and the United States. Plans start at $16.99/mo on the entry VDS Pro tier with NVMe storage, DDoS protection, and 99.9% uptime SLA. Best for Singapore-region latency, low-volume EU hosting, and small businesses that want predictable USD pricing.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $16.99/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Singapore datacenter recently relaunched (2026)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ NVMe storage on every plan, including the entry tier</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Anti-DDoS included by default across all 3 regions</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly billing flexibility</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 99.9% uptime SLA documented in the homepage hero</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Only 3 datacenters (Singapore / Germany / USA) — limited regional spread vs Vultr/DigitalOcean</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Young brand (launched late 2025), thin public review footprint beyond LowEndBox</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instance tier offered on the public VPS page</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No dedicated KVM / OpenVZ split; product line is VDS-only</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No public affiliate program detected — uses RackNerd fallback for monetization</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Pricing Snapshot (VDS — Virtual Dedicated Server)</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Verified 2026-07-16 from the <a href="https://kainode.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">Kainode homepage</a> pricing carousel. Same prices apply to all three datacenters.</p>
