    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Key Features</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Singapore Datacenter</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Singapore VPS is back after a 2025 supply-side pause — VDS Pro/Business/Enterprise all available with the same pricing as EU and US.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Anti-DDoS Included</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Hero feature: secure DDoS protection is included by default on every plan — no paid add-on required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">99.9% Uptime SLA</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Documented uptime SLA in the homepage hero, paired with instant deployment and full admin access.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">NVMe on Every Plan</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">All VDS tiers use NVMe storage, not SATA SSD — measurable latency advantage for I/O-heavy workloads.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Daily / Yearly Billing</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Choose daily ($0.25–$0.63), weekly, monthly, or yearly cycles — flexible for short-lived projects and dev workloads.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Multi-Region Coverage</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">3 datacenters (Singapore, Germany, USA) cover the major global traffic zones — short of Vultr's 32+ but adequate for most buyers.</p>
        </div>
