      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        Read the full <a href="/blog/kainode-vps-review-2026" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">Kainode VPS review 2026</a> for benchmarks, datacenter latency tests, and a side-by-side comparison vs RackNerd + Vultr.
