        <!-- In-Depth Review -->
        <div class="bg-[#111] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Verdict</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Kainode is a young 2025 brand with a sharp angle: Singapore VPS at a $16.99/mo entry, NVMe everywhere, and anti-DDoS as a default. For buyers whose traffic is APAC-heavy and who want predictable USD pricing without hyperscaler billing surprises, Kainode's VDS Business tier is the most competitive at $19.52/mo. The trade-offs are real — only three datacenters, no GPU tier, and a thin public review footprint — but the on-paper numbers hold up against RackNerd and Vultr for the use cases the brand targets. Read the <a href="/blog/kainode-vps-review-2026" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">full Kainode VPS review</a> for the benchmarks and side-by-side tables.</p>
        </div>

